Workstream ID: tracker-foundation
Title: Local-first tracker foundation and portable backups
Status: DONE
Milestone: Resumable, evidence-based career tracking in a static browser app
Dependencies: None
GitHub issue: https://github.com/Zanark/CareerOS/issues/1
Purpose: Preserve the implemented browser-local tracker, guarded evidence-based
  progression, capacity-bounded daily actions and portable explicit backup/import.
  This retrospective describes product behavior, never a person's achievements.

Tasks:
  [x] Implement mission focus, current checkpoints, readiness and daily planning.
  [x] Separate practice evidence from explicitly criteria-confirmed completion.
  [x] Validate saved/imported workspace schemas and references before replacement.
  [x] Handle recovery, storage failures, midnight drafts and stale browser tabs.
  [x] Document local privacy boundaries and explicit backup/import/reset.

Acceptance criteria:
  The static app can resume validated browser work without an account/backend.
  Activity, timers and plans never automatically grant checkpoint completion.
  Imports require confirmation; validation/storage failures preserve saved work.
  No private workspace, source PDF or actual progress is published by this record.

Completion evidence:
  Retrospective authored: 2026-11-06.
  Published source: commits 4a05f8a and c96b0b0 (2026-10-04).
  Maintained contracts: docs/GUIDE.md, docs/ARCHITECTURE.md, docs/PRIVACY.md,
    docs/AGENT_CONTRACT.md; src/useWorkspace.ts and src/workspaceFile.ts.
  Historical gate: https://github.com/Zanark/CareerOS/actions/runs/41529974393
    succeeded at 9b2903b0f1362e2318e9f8a81da379bc557f1309; metadata read back
    2026-11-06. Existing validation/build/browser jobs passed in that release.
  Human acceptance: not inferred. Real user data and personal outcomes unobserved.
  Publication: implementation already in public source; new tracking files local.
  Limitations: no new application execution or deployment during this migration.

Completion log:
  2026-10-04 - Published prototype and browser recovery/portability follow-up in
    4a05f8a/c96b0b0; dates are source history, not backdated GitHub issue metadata.
  2026-11-06 - Defined retrospective boundary from public source and current docs;
    no implementation changes, private-data import or new approval claim.
